scenario.en:
Inside one transaction (no savepoints):
1) BEGIN;
2) UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance - 100 WHERE id = 1;  -- ok
3) INSERT INTO accounts(id, balance) VALUES (1, 0);  -- duplicate PK, errors
4) SELECT balance FROM accounts WHERE id = 1;
What does statement 4 return, and what is the balance after you finally COMMIT?

